  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU skills DipAcademy</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EU-kunnande inom Diplomat</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A request has been sent from the Diplomatic Academy, Ministry of Foreign Affairs in Ukraine to the Swedish Ministry of Foreign Affairs regarding support to building up EU skills as part of a harmonization of the training with similar trainings in other EU member states. The project is planned as a tripartite cooperation with the Estonian School of Diplomacy.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">En f&#xF6;rfr&#xE5;gan har s&#xE4;nts fr&#xE5;n Diplomatic Academy, Ministry of Foreign Affairs in Ukraine, till UD ang st&#xF6;d till en uppbyggnad av EU-kunnande som skall ing&#xE5; i diplomatutbildningen i Ukraina, samt en allm&#xE4;n harmonisering med liknande utbildningar i Europa. St&#xF6;det &#xE4;r t&#xE4;nkt som ett trepartssamarbete med Estland.</narrative>
  </description>
